Promotion criterion (HANDOFF_PROCESS v4.3.1): **mechanical** (Stage 1 <2 critical,
severity 4-5/5) **AND judgment** (reviewer Stage 3 verdict PROMOTE or PROMOTE WITH
CAVEATS). Both required; reviewer judgment overrides count. Met → promote
`beta → stable` (flip the stamp in `.claude/commands/handoff.md` +
`templates/handoff/README.md.tmpl`); not met → v-X.Y+1 cycle. **Do not begin
downstream work assuming the version is stable before Rob has the verdict** — that is
the easy-metric premature-closure failure mode this process exists to prevent.

